Ow, ow, ow! You're gonna pull it off!

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:30.080
But I never expected you to be the 
photographer for our school trip, Masuda-san.

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:30.540
Huh?

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:36.520
Well, I occasionally tag along with one of 
my seniors to take photos on school trips.

00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:41.300
Masuda~

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:41.300
Could you help
me out again?

