on coming along as an assistant.

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:57.920
Leave it to me!

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:57.920
I can see it
clear as day!

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:57.920
I'm so sorry!

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:01.030
Masuda-san! Could you 
take some photos for us?

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:05.350
Sure thing! Well, I'll see you two later.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.640
Masuda-san sure is popular.

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:12.380
Well, he is easy to get along with.

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:14.770
Hey, we should take some photos, too.

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:15.450
Sure.

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:18.130
