00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:33.550
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:35.810
Matsushima.

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:37.840
Hey, Amakusa.

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:39.290
