00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:52.160
<i>Wait, why?!</i>

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:52.160
<b>Wait,</b>

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:52.160
<b>why?!</b>

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:56.130
<i>How did my keychain that should be 
in my room end up in my purse?!</i>

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:56.920
<i>What's going on?!</i>

00:03:57.590 --> 00:04:00.160
<i>Actually, I think I bumped into 
my corkboard this morning</i>

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:01.420
