00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:18.760
Oh, I think my sister's keychain 
somehow ended up in my—

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:21.640
This is Toho from <i>Forward World</i>, isn't it?

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:22.530
Huh?

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:25.110
Huh... I guess you like it, too.

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:26.990
Y-You've heard of it?

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:31.010
Yeah... Toho was pretty awesome 
in episode 8 of the anime.

00:04:31.010 --> 00:04:33.460
Episode 8? OMG, I know, right?!

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:35.580
<b>Gasp!</b>

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:35.580
I totally cried the whole episode!

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:40.000
I figured you didn't watch 
stuff like that, Amakusa.

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:43.150
Yeah, I wasn't that interested.

00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:48.050
But someone I know is into anime, 
so I started watching because of them.

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:51.970
<i>I researched the hell out of it 
since Ichika-san loves it so much.</i>

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:51.970
Ah, so this is foreshadowing...

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:51.970
The animation director is...

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:54.900
Actually, I had no idea that you liked anime.

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:56.580
Yeah, well...

00:04:56.580 --> 00:05:02.900
Listen, could you keep the fact that 
I like anime a secret at work?

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:05.080
Sure. But why would you hide it?

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:05.860
m 0 0 l 67 0 l 67 165 l 0 165

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:05.880
Doesn't
understand
undercover
anime
nerds

