Huh?

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:10.600
I'd prefer to keep this 
hobby a secret... So, yeah.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.570
Huh... Okay, sure.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:16.150
If you ever want to talk 
about anime, hit me up.

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:16.750
I want more info
on anime anyway...

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:20.130
It's gotta be tough holding 
back on something you enjoy.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.020
See ya.

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:24.410
S-Sure.

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:34.140
<i>That was the last thing I expected,</i>

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:37.100
<i>but I think he will keep 
it a secret, at least.</i>

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:40.960
It's gotta be tough holding 
back on something you enjoy.

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:46.440
<i>I think my opinion of
Amakusa improved a bit.</i>

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:53.450
<i>I totally got separated 
from Rio and the others.</i>

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:58.040
<i>To top it off, my phone's dead, 
so I can't contact them.</i>

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:01.040
I'm sorry!

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.800
<b>Throb</b>

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.800
