00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:08.440
I got separated from everyone else.

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:13.390
Oh, hey. Do you happen to know Rio, 
Sacchan, or Ru-chan's contact info?

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:15.340
No, I don't...

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:16.770
I see.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:22.040
Well, our route is laid out, so you'll 
probably run into them eventually.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:24.980
Why don't you just look around and have fun?

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:27.590
Actually, that's a good point.

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:28.910
Thanks.

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:32.470
Hey, are you by yourself, too?

00:06:32.470 --> 00:06:35.130
Nah, I'm with a group...

