00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:39.330
Why didn't you just
say something, Kai?

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:38.700
<i>We got your back, bro!</i>

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:39.330
We got your back, bro!

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:39.330
