00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:50.540
J-Just a little! Just, like, a teaspoon! 
Only a tiny bit!

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:53.860
<i>And my happiness is as vast as the ocean!</i>

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:56.230
That sounds very broad and deep.

00:10:57.660 --> 00:11:03.040
Oh, that reminds me. One of my 
coworkers likes <i>Forward World</i>.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.700
<i>What?! Really?!</i>

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:09.240
<i>She asked me not to mention it at work, 
but telling Ichika-san should be fine.</i>

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:12.110
<i>They apparently like Toho, too.</i>

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:13.900
We even have the same fave!

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:14.310
Gasp!

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:14.310
m -41 13 b -10 13 13 13 44 13 b 44 5 44 -12 44 -21 b 13 -21 -10 -21 -41 -21

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:14.310
<b>Fave</b>

