<i>Fave? I think they like anime in general.</i>

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:21.700
Arrietty arrives home

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:21.700
Yeah,
I totally bumped into it

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:21.700
Others fell, too

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:20.160
Really? I wonder what other shows they like.

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:21.700
<i>I'll ask them next time.</i>

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:23.860
<i>Yes! If you could!</i>

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:28.510
<i>Ichika-san gets so excited when she 
talks about anime. She's so cute.</i>

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:30.670
<i>Okay, I'm gonna head back now.</i>

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:33.860
Sure. Have fun tomorrow, too.

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:34.840
Goodnight.

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:36.560
Goodnight.

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:38.410
Hngh!

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:41.530
Tamaru-kun?

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:43.390
Hit his elbow on the wall

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:43.390
<i>Today is not my day.</i>

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:51.250
<b>Throbbing</b>

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:44.850
What's wrong?

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:49.120
I was just passing by on my way to buy a drink...

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:51.200
Oh, do you mind if I join you?

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:53.150
Huh? Sure...

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:55.600
I was gonna buy drinks for everyone.

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:58.800
Everyone? Oh, you mean 
Amakusa and the others.

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:02.800
Yeah! We're gonna figure out what we 
want to do with our free time tomorrow.

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:04.870
Free time...

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:13.250
...while you're not here...

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:15.560
does make me miss you...

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:17.320
a little.

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:20.590
Arima.

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:23.480
For your free time tomorrow...

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:26.280
Why not hang out with me?

00:12:28.490 --> 00:12:29.190
Huh?

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:34.980
Koikimo

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:39.980
Koikimo

