I'd like to request
a business trip!!

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:39.980
O-Okinawa?

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:39.980
<b>The request didn't go through</b>

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:43.860
I think it's somewhere around here.

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:47.370
Yeah, it's right here. This angle.

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:49.680
Whoa, it really is that exact angle!

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:51.210
Uh... Yeah.

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:53.460
I need to rewatch the movie when I get home.

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:56.020
This is so exciting!

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:56.020
You seem to be having fun.

00:12:56.020 --> 00:12:58.210
Yeah, I am! I'm so moved!

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:00.210
