00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:08.180
I'm gonna go buy something to 
drink. Could you wait here?

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:11.100
S-Sure. See you in a bit.

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:16.100
<i>He really surprised me yesterday.</i>

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:18.590
For your free time tomorrow...

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:20.430
Why not hang out with me?

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:23.110
Huh?

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:25.410
I-I, uh...

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:27.470
We can do a pilgrimage.

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:28.320
Huh?

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:32.170
The place where the <i>Forward World</i> 
movie takes place is nearby.

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:36.090
You're right! They do go to Okinawa!

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:37.850
<i>Wow, he startled me.</i>

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:44.370
Yeah, I'd love to go! But do you mind 
if I talk to Rio and the others first?

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:46.510
Uh... sure.

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:50.220
<i>When I told them I was going 
to go around with Tamaru-kun,</i>

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:53.720
<i>Sacchan and Ru-chan were oddly excited.</i>

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:56.250
Really?! Way to go, Tamaru!

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:57.940
Um... We're
just going to
do a nerd
pilgrimage...

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:57.940
Oh, to be young!

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:03.280
<i>But Rio seemed to make a weird face.</i>

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:05.780
Welcome

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:10.030
Are you concerned about 
Ichika and Tamaru-kun?

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:14.460
"Not at all"... might be a lie.

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:17.120
Well, you are her best friend.

00:14:17.340 --> 00:14:21.000
Tamaru told me he didn't 
really have feelings for her.

00:14:21.930 --> 00:14:25.360
Oh? Well, maybe his feelings changed.

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:26.340
Could be.

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:31.720
But inviting her to do a nerd pilgrimage 
is really cute of Tamaru-kun.

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:34.560
Ruri, you're acting like a mom again.

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:40.360
<i>I'm not just concerned as her best friend, 
but also as someone's little sister.</i>

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:43.230
Hand-picked

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:43.230
<b>Jasmine Tea</b>

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:45.470
<i>I'm really thirsty for some reason.</i>

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:53.450
Arima!

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:01.020
Ah, my boy Tamaru!

00:15:02.010 --> 00:15:05.060
Oh, it's just you, Masuda-san.

00:15:05.060 --> 00:15:07.550
Huh? Why? Should it not be me?

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:11.140
No, I just thought someone 
was hitting on Ari—

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:11.850
Huh?

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:19.810
Ah... I see. You thought someone was 
hitting on her, so you came to save her.

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:21.760
How chivalrous, my guy!

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:23.440
<b>Ha ha ha ha ha</b>

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:23.440
That hurts...

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:27.190
Anyway, I'm gonna go get 
photos of the other kids.

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:33.130
<i>Would you look at that? 
Yeah, Ryo's definitely got a rival.</i>

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:35.470
<i>Man, it must be so nice to be young.</i>

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:37.980
<i>Refreshing and bittersweet like citrus!</i>

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:39.600
<i>He didn't want to butt in...</i>

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:41.320
Um, Tamaru-kun...

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:42.120
Huh?

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:43.400
My arm...

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:44.960
<b>Blush</b>

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:50.630
<b>Sewer</b>

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:50.630
<b>Paper Kite Butterfly</b>

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:48.000
Sorry! I didn't mean to yank your arm...

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:49.500
Oh, it's fine.

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:51.810
H-Here's your tea.

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:54.490
Oh... Thanks. How much was it?

00:15:54.490 --> 00:15:57.480
Don't worry about it. 
Since I'm just in high school,

00:15:57.480 --> 00:15:59.680
this is about all I can treat you to.

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:05.450
Arima, thanks for hanging out with me today.

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:08.440
No, no. Thank you for inviting me!

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:11.340
Since we went around together, 
the excitement was doubled!

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:11.820
Doubled~

00:16:13.140 --> 00:16:14.570
What the heck?

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:20.520
I-I guess it's almost time to meet back up.

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:22.020
Yeah, let's go.

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:26.420
<i>I'm not sure what it is, but...</i>

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:30.930
<i>Did Tamaru-kun always make faces like that?</i>

00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:37.360
I can't believe our school 
trip's already over.

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:40.220
Maybe we can come back 
for our graduation trip.

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:44.770
Hey, Rio. Does Ryo-san not like sweets?

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:47.310
I think he likes them just fine.

00:16:47.660 --> 00:16:49.630
Okay, that's good.

00:16:49.630 --> 00:16:52.230
Is that a gift for my brother?

00:16:52.230 --> 00:16:54.950
Yeah, I ended up getting him some sweets.

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:57.700
Is that too basic?

00:16:59.020 --> 00:17:01.690
Maybe I should've gotten
something other than food.

00:17:01.690 --> 00:17:04.410
I'm sure my brother will 
be more than happy to have

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:06.340
any gift you thought hard about getting him.

00:17:06.340 --> 00:17:07.530
Huh?

00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:09.460
We're going to board soon.

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.370
Yes, sir.

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:16.840
So, Ichika-san...

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:24.850
<b>Good Happy Guy</b>

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:18.320
What movie should we watch?

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:20.030
Don't give me that.

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:20.580
Huh?

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:24.340
I just came to give you 
your gift from my trip.

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:24.850
<b>Gift</b>

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:30.240
I did find it weird that you wanted 
to meet in front of a movie theater.

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:32.840
Did you have plans after this?

00:17:32.840 --> 00:17:36.740
Unfortunately, no. Anyway, I'm going home.

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:35.130
Sad...

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:39.960
Ichika-san, please wait. Since we're here...

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:43.710
Ichika-san?

00:17:45.010 --> 00:17:47.930
Okay, just let go of my hand.

00:17:51.220 --> 00:17:54.350
Shall we have you escorted 
away by the police?

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:57.590
I'm sorry. I went a bit too far.

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:57.590
Please, no

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:01.180
So, what movie did you want to watch?

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:05.880
Actually, let's watch 
something you want to watch.

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:07.230
Me?

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:12.440
You apparently know what I like, 
as annoying as that is...

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:16.400
Well, I have insider information.

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:16.400
<b>You rang?</b>

00:18:16.710 --> 00:18:21.280
But I don't think I know 
anything about what you like.

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:26.080
The only thing I like is you, Ichik—

00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:27.800
Yeah, stop. Just pick a movie.

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:32.720
I'll go buy our drinks.

00:18:32.720 --> 00:18:33.420
Okay.

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:39.050
<b>Recording movies
in the theater
is a crime.</b>

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:39.050
<i>When he grabbed my arm earlier, 
it reminded me of Tamaru-kun.</i>

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:43.260
<i>I could tell he was nervous and not used to it.</i>

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:47.390
<i>That must be how high school boys are.</i>

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:51.090
<i>He was completely different from 
Ryo-san, who's a confident adult.</i>

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:54.770
<i>He held my hand. Wait...</i>

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:57.620
<i>Why am I comparing them?</i>

00:18:57.620 --> 00:19:00.330
<i>Wow, this is awful. Ugh...</i>

00:19:00.330 --> 00:19:01.280
Ichika-san.

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:02.390
Y-Yes?

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:03.840
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:19:03.840 --> 00:19:06.640
I bought some popcorn. 
Why don't we share it?

00:19:05.030 --> 00:19:08.290
Salt

00:19:05.030 --> 00:19:08.290
Caramel

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:08.290
Hey, that sounds great!

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:10.300
I haven't had popcorn in forever!

00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:14.320
Oh, dear. I'd love to have some 
myself, but my hands are full.

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:16.730
Could you feed some to me?

00:19:16.730 --> 00:19:19.240
Then I can just hold it for you.

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:21.670
Oh, I'll just set it down right here.

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:21.950
<b>Feed-me challenge failed</b>

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:27.190
Also, it gets a bit chilly in this 
theater, so I bought a blanket.

00:19:27.190 --> 00:19:28.090
Here you go.

00:19:28.090 --> 00:19:29.830
Thank you very much.

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:32.790
<i>To our patrons with tickets 
to theater number 3,</i>

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:34.930
<i>please come to the theater entrance.</i>

00:19:33.140 --> 00:19:34.570
We should get going.

00:19:39.100 --> 00:19:41.140
Um... Is this it?

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:42.870
Ichika-san.

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:46.890
You can probably see the 
screen better from this seat.

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:48.540
Oh, okay.

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:53.140
Here's your drink, and help 
yourself to some popcorn.

00:19:53.140 --> 00:19:54.300
Thank you.

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:59.880
<i>Other guys were sitting over there, 
so he switched with me.</i>

00:20:02.120 --> 00:20:03.260
<i>He's so used to this.</i>

00:20:03.580 --> 00:20:07.510
<i>It's insanely obvious that Ryo-san 
is used to going on dates.</i>

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:10.270
<i>Of course he is, though. It's Ryo-san.</i>

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:14.540
<i>He must've been to this theater 
before, too... with another lady.</i>

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:22.820
<i>Maybe I should've worn 
something more sophisticated.</i>

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:28.790
<i>I want to ask her what happened 
with Tamaru on their trip, but I can't.</i>

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:33.500
Ichika-san and Tamaru spent 
their free time together?!

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:36.830
Yeah. They were together 
at the aquarium, too.

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:42.730
Dude, I told you everything I know. 
You can ask her the rest yourself.

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:48.010
<i>Am I afraid something might 
have happened between them?</i>

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:50.400
<i>How lame can I be?</i>

00:21:39.300 --> 00:21:43.520
It's a remake of a classic film, 
and it got pretty decent reviews.

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:45.360
Ichika-san?

00:21:45.940 --> 00:21:48.240
Huh? Oh, right.

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:52.280
The leading actress was really 
sophisticated and pretty.

00:21:54.280 --> 00:21:59.420
You don't seem to be feeling well, 
so I'll walk you home now.

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:00.890
Huh? No...

00:22:00.890 --> 00:22:03.040
It's not that I don't feel well...

00:22:05.930 --> 00:22:06.990
Ryo-san?

00:22:06.990 --> 00:22:08.570
Yes? What is it?

00:22:08.570 --> 00:22:11.010
Are you feeling okay, Ryo-san?

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:13.080
Oh, I'm fine.

00:22:13.080 --> 00:22:14.960
Okay...

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:20.610
<i>He looks serious. That's new.</i>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.250
Next Time

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.250
"Unrequited Love"

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:38.460
Next time, "Unrequited Love."
